  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our large Carter backpack goes from the office to the airport without a wardrobe change. 100% recycled nylon keeps it light for the commute, and interior and exterior pockets keep everything within quick reach. The luggage sleeve slips right over your suitcase handle when it's time to board—zero checked bag drama.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% recycled nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 3.5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable shoulder straps with 37&quot; drop at longest</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior 2 slip pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (hot fudge); Silver hardware (black)</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 11.4&quot; (L) x 15&quot; (H) x 5.90&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
